OL,3,ADame Esther Rantzen: That's Life!
OL,4,Apresenter, Childline founder and
OL,5,Acampaigner for assisted dying
OL,6,
OL,7,FDame Esther Rantzen, who has died at
OL,8,Fthe age of 86, was best known for
OL,9,Fpresenting the BBC TV programme That's
OL,10,FLife!
OL,12,FOver two decades, what started as a
OL,13,Fconsumer programme with quirky asides
OL,14,Fbecame renowned for its high-profile
OL,15,Fcampaigns, notably against child abuse.
OL,17,FIt resulted in Dame Esther setting up
OL,18,FChildline, a national telephone
OL,19,Fhelpline for children suffering abuse
OL,20,For neglect.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
